WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:05.171
[ Bells jingling ]
♪♪

00:00:05.171 --> 00:00:08.140
-All right, who wants to meet
Santa Claus?

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:09.242
-Me!
-Me!

00:00:09.242 --> 00:00:10.776
-All right.
Right this --

00:00:10.776 --> 00:00:12.312
-Move, move, move
out of the way.

00:00:12.312 --> 00:00:14.079
I want to meet Santa.
Look at you guys.

00:00:14.079 --> 00:00:15.081
Thank you.

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:21.420
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:23.556
Look at you guys.

00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:25.992
Look at you guys.
Very small. Sad.

00:00:25.992 --> 00:00:27.159
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.159 --> 00:00:29.829
Here, hold my Mango-A-Go-Go.
Take my pretzel.

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:31.831
-[ Laughs ]
-Santa, hello.

00:00:31.831 --> 00:00:34.834
-Is that you, Mr. President?
-Of course it is.

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:36.569
Look, I don't have much time.

00:00:36.569 --> 00:00:39.139
I ditched Eric and Don Jr.
at the Disney Store.

00:00:39.139 --> 00:00:40.706
Won't be long until they realize

00:00:40.706 --> 00:00:43.543
the Thor beanbag chair I left
them on isn't their real dad.

00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:44.911
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:47.680
-So you came to the mall
just to see Santa?

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:50.250
-That's right. Tomorrow's
the big impeachment vote.

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:52.451
And people are saying that
all I can do is pray.

00:00:52.451 --> 00:00:55.588
But why pray when I can come
straight to you, Jesus' dad?

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:58.324
-Oh, I'm not -- I'm not. No.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.324 --> 00:01:00.726
-Besides, I love malls,
I really do.

00:01:00.726 --> 00:01:03.696
The sights, the sounds,
the Szechuan samples.

00:01:03.696 --> 00:01:04.897
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.897 --> 00:01:07.333
But even here, I can't escape
the Democrats.

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:08.901
They're very mean, Santa.
They're very mean.

00:01:08.901 --> 00:01:10.503
They're very nasty.
-Mm.

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:12.338
[ Laughter ]
They're very nasty.

00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:14.139
They're very nasty people.
-Nasty, yes.

00:01:14.139 --> 00:01:15.808
-They do nasty things.

00:01:15.808 --> 00:01:18.544
They want to impeach me
just like Clinton and Nixon

00:01:18.544 --> 00:01:21.347
and Prancer and Vixen.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.347 --> 00:01:22.949
But that would be
very humiliating,

00:01:22.949 --> 00:01:25.985
and the only person who can
humiliate me is me.

00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:29.589
-Well, that is not true.
-Thank you, Santa. Thank you.

00:01:29.589 --> 00:01:31.491
Lucky for me, there's one
thing I believe in,

00:01:31.491 --> 00:01:33.326
and that's the Christmas spirit.

00:01:33.326 --> 00:01:35.060
So if this whole thing
goes kablooey,

00:01:35.060 --> 00:01:37.296
I have a few Christmas wishes
I want to make.

00:01:37.296 --> 00:01:39.098
Here, I wrote them down.

00:01:39.098 --> 00:01:41.734
[ Laughter ]
-Oh...

00:01:44.003 --> 00:01:46.105
-Now don't worry, I'm not going
to ask for dirt on Biden.

00:01:46.105 --> 00:01:47.941
I learned my lesson.
You can't --

00:01:47.941 --> 00:01:49.909
You can't ask a foreign leader
for help,

00:01:49.909 --> 00:01:52.177
and you, of course,
are the president of Alaska.

00:01:52.177 --> 00:01:55.047
-Uh, incorrect, incorrect.
-So my first wish --

00:01:55.047 --> 00:01:56.616
and we all knew
this was coming --

00:01:56.616 --> 00:01:58.784
we have to do something about
Nancy Pelosi.

00:01:58.784 --> 00:02:01.554
I mean, she's being
a real Omarosa Scrooge.

00:02:01.554 --> 00:02:04.157
And -- I'm not asking you to do
anything to Nancy,

00:02:04.157 --> 00:02:05.758
but you ever heard the song,

00:02:05.758 --> 00:02:07.192
"Grandma Got Run Over
by a Reindeer"?

00:02:07.192 --> 00:02:08.461
[ Laughter ]
-[ Mutters ]

00:02:08.461 --> 00:02:09.796
-Just think about it.
Just think about it.

00:02:09.796 --> 00:02:13.065
Doesn't have to be a reindeer,
but...

00:02:13.065 --> 00:02:15.568
Could be a golf cart.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.568 --> 00:02:17.169
I'm not micromanaging.
-Oh, boy. Okay --

00:02:17.169 --> 00:02:19.205
-So that was my first wish.
And I get three, right?

00:02:19.205 --> 00:02:21.274
Are we playing by Aladdin rules?
-No, not exactly.

00:02:21.274 --> 00:02:24.510
But you can ask for gifts
for your friends.

00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:27.013
-Great. Any tips on
what to get a Russian dictator

00:02:27.013 --> 00:02:29.415
who has everything?
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.415 --> 00:02:31.217
I'm pretty sure he's buying me
another election,

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:32.718
so I want to
get him something good.

00:02:32.718 --> 00:02:34.720
-Well --
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:36.155
-Oh, I have this one friend --

00:02:36.155 --> 00:02:38.858
let's call him Rudy the
Brown-Nosed Reindeer.

00:02:38.858 --> 00:02:40.192
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.192 --> 00:02:41.794
He's trying to save himself
from going to --

00:02:41.794 --> 00:02:43.062
let's call it prison.

00:02:43.062 --> 00:02:45.798
-So your Christmas wish
is that he ends up okay.

00:02:45.798 --> 00:02:46.932
How nice.
-No, no,

00:02:46.932 --> 00:02:51.103
I'll just get him a Peloton.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.103 --> 00:02:53.539
Oh, look.
If I'm being honest, Santa,

00:02:53.539 --> 00:02:56.142
this impeachment thing is really
scaring me --

00:02:56.142 --> 00:02:57.776
like Melania's
Christmas decorations.

00:02:57.776 --> 00:02:59.646
Or stairs.

00:02:59.646 --> 00:03:01.213
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.213 --> 00:03:03.149
I just hope it all works out
in the end.

00:03:03.149 --> 00:03:05.451
-Well, Donald,
if you do get impeached,

00:03:05.451 --> 00:03:09.022
it's still up to the Senate
to remove you, you know.

00:03:09.022 --> 00:03:11.224
-It is?
And that will never happen.

00:03:11.224 --> 00:03:15.094
Because the Senate is run by
my elves, the Republicans.

00:03:15.094 --> 00:03:16.663
And that is the greatest
gift of all.

00:03:16.663 --> 00:03:19.766
Thank you, Santa.
My Christmas wish came true.

00:03:19.766 --> 00:03:21.934
And oh, yeah, "The Tonight Show"
starts right now.

00:03:21.934 --> 00:03:23.402
Come on. Let's do this!
-Whoo!

00:03:23.402 --> 00:03:26.472
♪♪
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:26.472 --> 00:03:30.175
-From 30 Rockefeller Plaza
right here in New York City,

00:03:30.175 --> 00:03:33.412
it's "The Tonight Show
Starring Jimmy Fallon."

00:03:33.412 --> 00:03:35.047
♪♪

00:03:35.047 --> 00:03:38.751
And now, here he is,

00:03:38.751 --> 00:03:42.321
Jimmy Fallon!

00:03:42.321 --> 00:03:44.623
[ Cheers and applause ]
-♪ Hey, hey, hey, hey ♪

00:03:44.623 --> 00:03:46.426
-♪ Hey, hey, hey, hey ♪

00:03:46.426 --> 00:03:49.495
-♪ Hey, hey, hey, he-ey ♪

00:03:49.495 --> 00:03:51.430
-Give it up! Ah!

00:03:51.430 --> 00:03:53.833
The Roots!
Nice to see you! Hi!

00:03:53.833 --> 00:03:55.935
-♪ Hey ♪

